<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFramework>netstandard2.0</TargetFramework>
		<Authors>Kamran Fallah</Authors>
		<Company>-</Company>
		<Product>KamiSama.Extenders.Ninject</Product>
		<Description>Ninject Wrapper with BindTo additional attribute.</Description>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>v1.1.0 almost redesigned
- ioc-settings is removed from package
- container does not have two kernels anymore. instead use Container.ActiveProfiles
- ApplyBindToAttributes extender is added.
- WhenProfileIs condition is added.
v1.0.0
- initial version
		</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<Version>1.1.0</Version>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
		<DebugType>Full</DebugType>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://gitlab.com/kamran65536/KamiSama</RepositoryUrl>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="Ninject" Version="3.3.4" />
		<PackageReference Include="Ninject.Extensions.Conventions" Version="3.3.0" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
	  <ProjectReference Include="..\KamiSama.Extenders.Attributes\KamiSama.Extenders.Attributes.csproj" />
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>
